  "progression": "45 EC first-year standard under general A6.2 with personal-circumstance protections. Module 8 project requires Dynamics 1 or System Analysis and at most one module 4 resit. Minor entry requires 90 EC including 52 from year one and at most 4.5 concurrent outstanding EC. Academic Research & Skills requires year one completed and credits of 26 across modules 5–6, 11.5 in module 7 and 8.5 in module 8. Module 12 research follows a passed proposal. B4 gives 12 EC research and 3 EC societal embedding. No separate non-credit completion unit or Enschede transition provision was identified. The course-only Osiris links were inaccessible via retrieval and were superseded in this record by the official table, project descriptions and adopted regulations."
}
